 "message": "A 12-frame, one-shot white and pale-blue crescent slash with a sharp diagonal arc. Frame 1 is a short anticipation glow, frames 3 to 5 are the full impact with a flash, crosshair and sparks, and frames 6 to 11 dissipate into a grey smoke puff and drifting sparks. Try the slash's facing and sweep sliders for the angle and length of the arc, and the smoke colour and lumpiness sliders for the dissipation. I kept the 16-bit look with a few colours and a dark outline, but I did not do a hard palette reduction beyond that.",
